---
// Hairline. Reads as contained or full-bleed purely by where the parent
// places it: inside `.content` for contained, as a direct child of a
// full-width <section> for full-bleed. No prop, no breakout margin math.
---

<hr class="rule" />

<style>
	.rule {
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0;
		border: none;
		border-top: var(--rule-weight) solid var(--rule);
	}
</style>
